== Reward ==

<ul><li>  {{:Shestar's Scaled Coif}} ([[blacksmithing|smithed]])
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

[[Trooper Shestar]], inside the gates to the Field of Bone, wants 5 gp and three {{:Loose Scale}}s.  In return, he gives you {{:Shestar's Unfinished Coif}}.  The unfinished coif grants no AC, but he tells you that you can fix it up if you are a blacksmith and use 3 more loose scales.  So run out and get three more loose scales, combine them in a forge with the unfinished coif (no water needed), and you will get the Shestar's Scaled Coif for your troubles.

You say, 'Hail, Trooper Shestar'

:Trooper Shestar says, 'My father was a great blacksmith.  He taught me how to make great items such as the [Shestar scaled coif].  Alas, smithing was not my rebirth, but rather the life of a warrior.'

You say, 'What is the Shestar scaled coif?'

:Trooper Shestar says, 'The Shestar Scaled Coif was a light coif my father would fashion out of loose scales from the scaled wolves.  I have some scales on me and if you bring me three loose scales I will have enough to create the coif for you, but I require you to also pay a fee of five gold.'

'''You give Trooper Shestar 3 scaled wolf scales and 5 gold.'''

:Trooper Shestar quickly inserts the scales into a half finished coif and hands you the coif. 'I am afraid that is not enough and I cannot possibly complete the task while on duty. You must go and find an additional three [[Loose Scale|Scaled Wolf Scales]] and take them, along with the Unfinished Coif, to the nearest forge and complete the smithing yourself. I hope you are a blacksmith.'

(No faction or experience is awarded.)

'''In any forge combine 1x [[Shestar's Unfinished Coif]] + 3x [[Loose Scale]]s to create [[Shestar's Scaled Coif]]. This completes the quest.'''

''Giving the coif to Shestar after crafting it causes you to lose the coif with no dialog.''

